select public.admin_notify('🧭 D58: Unified login hi hamara rasta — Facebook login tab legacy hai', 'Owner ne Customize use case page par "API setup with Facebook login" tab dekha aur poocha kya wo asaan hai. Jawab diya: NAHI — wo legacy path hai (Meta ka own yellow banner: Unified recommended, Facebook login ab legacy). Facebook login path me extra drama: har IG account ko Facebook Page se link karna padta (owner ka D45 decision: koi FB Page nahi), pages_*+business_management permissions aur App Review ki jhanjhat, aur tokens ~60 din me expire (refresh cron chahiye) — jabki hamara SUAT NEVER expire. Hamara saara kaam (DM hub, messaging) existing Unified configuration (Config ID 1149100804208223) se hi hoga; us page par kuch click nahi karna. Blocker fix sequence wahi: FB session=developer account, App roles me Admin, Settings→Basic me Privacy Policy URL+Category Save, Login URL retry; zaroorat ho tabhi Live mode.', 'session_end') as notified;
